    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "水の音を流しながら「音楽」を楽しむことができます。",
      "english_translation": "You can enjoy \"music\" while listening to the sound of water."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "そして、日本のガラス、着物、陶器、建築を取り入れて、「日本文化」も知ることができます。",
      "english_translation": "And, you can also learn about \"Japanese culture\" by experiencing items such as Japanese glass, kimonos, pottery, and architecture."
